WEBVTT

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:08.320
Men!

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:11.000
Clean hit. Point awarded.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.150
Did you see that?

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:13.850
That was so cool!

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:15.280
Bow.

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:23.660
But you know...

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:26.380
What? Saeki-san and Kamio-kun?

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.910
Yep, they live together!

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:31.060
<i>Why...</i>

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:34.010
<i>Why is this happening to me?</i>

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:47.520
<b>Silver Fox</b>

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:07.880
<b>How Do I Look?</b>

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:06.260
How come everyone knows?

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:07.830
We asked him where he lived.

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:08.810
And he answered...

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:10.320
The Saeki shrine.

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:13.420
That's your home, right?

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:15.260
U-Um...

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:18.590
He's a friend of the family 
that's staying with us.

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:20.360
He transferred to this school 
because he practices kendo.

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:22.250
That makes sense.

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:25.510
Our school does well every 
year and Kamio-kun's

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:27.540
already a starter on our team.

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:29.780
He's a modern version 
of a dashing swordsman.

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:31.040
Absolutely.

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:35.670
Give me a break...

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:39.170
It appears that the transfer 
student is very popular.

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:43.390
Is he handsome like 
Ikegami-san was hoping?

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:45.600
Are you interested, Funabashi-san?

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:47.430
No, not especially.

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:49.400
But I heard that his grades are also good.

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:50.850
Sounds like he can do everything.

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:54.460
Saeki!

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:55.520
Yumi-chan.

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:06.460
<i>This is awkward...</i>

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:09.200
<i>How do I bring up Yumi-chan's proposal?</i>

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:11.790
Thank you for the meal.

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:21.590
Oh, that's not necessary.

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:23.390
You washed the dishes last night.

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:24.910
It's Makoto's turn.

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:26.060
O-Okay.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:28.310
Satoru-kun, I can do it.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.470
Excuse me.

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:37.060
Satoru-kun, you should take a bath.

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:39.220
You must be tired after practice.

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:41.020
I'll go last.

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:43.150
Please let me know when you're done.

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:44.740
Come on, Dad...

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:49.030
You'll make him uncomfortable 
if you keep bugging him.

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:52.160
But he always goes straight to 
his room when he comes home.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:54.630
He's pulling an Amaterasu-sama on us.

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:57.740
You know how she hid 
in the Ama-no-Iwato?

00:03:57.740 --> 00:03:59.480
He'll get used to living 
here eventually.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:03.370
But he's acting the same 
way at school, right?

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:07.020
The girls were making a 
fuss because he's good

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:08.810
at kendo and a good student.

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:12.020
Oh, Dad. So, tomorrow...

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:24.500
It's a smaller shrine, 
but it's a lot quieter.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:27.640
Tatsuo is a nice guy.

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:30.670
Makoto talks too much.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:35.140
Satoru, you keep grunting.

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:36.380
Are you listening to me?

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:38.460
I am.

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:42.850
Man, you're plastered all over him.

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:44.150
Can you be more obnoxious?

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:45.120
Quiet!

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:46.510
Ugly! Fatty!

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:48.320
Hey, Haru!

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:51.060
Wait, what are you doing?

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:54.290
It's your turn, Gintaro-sama.

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:58.980
Don't bother. I don't like people 
doing that kind of stuff.

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:03.440
That won't do. 
You represent this shrine.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.070
It's okay, really.

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:06.310
I can't accept that.

00:05:06.310 --> 00:05:07.360
It's okay!

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:13.420
You kicked Satoru!

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:17.250
F-Forgive me for offending you.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.630
Apologize!

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:20.170
Apologize to Satoru!

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:22.740
Hey, what are you doing, Gin?

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:23.680
<i>Makoto doesn't mind when 
I'm rough with her...</i>

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:25.670
That hurts! Stop it!

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:25.670
<i>But I don't know how to 
deal with this kid...</i>

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:30.240
You don't have to apologize every time.

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:33.140
It's not worth the time.

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:37.900
You should probably spend 
that effort on other humans.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:41.570
I-I've been trying my best.

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:43.020
Satoru-kun!

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:46.030
Look, there's the noisy girl.

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:47.740
Get some practice.

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:50.700
Sorry about making you help out.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:53.600
Are you missing practice?

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:54.860
It's not a big deal.

00:05:54.860 --> 00:05:56.210
I helped out when I was home.

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:59.880
Helping out at the shrine is 
more important than kendo.

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:05.140
So, Satoru-kun, do you have 
any plans after this?

00:06:05.140 --> 00:06:05.880
What?

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:08.550
Hey! What are you up to?!

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:10.730
N-Nothing!

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:12.110
Hey, walk on the left!

00:06:12.110 --> 00:06:13.580
Did you forget what they taught us?

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:15.060
Did they say something?

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:16.890
They're already here?

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:19.770
Heya! Saeki, we're here!

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:23.180
Wow, you're both wearing kimonos!

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:27.530
We were performing a 
purification this morning.

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:29.590
Oh, really?

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:30.990
This should be fun.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:32.570
More noisy girls around.

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:36.000
Um, I don't believe you've 
met them before, Satoru-kun.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.750
These are my classmates...

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:39.370
Ikegami Yumi.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:40.970
Funabashi Hiwako.

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:42.300
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:43.970
I'm Kamio...

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:48.930
Um, we're going to throw a 
welcome party for you today.

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:53.390
Heh, you really are living 
at Saeki's place.

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:56.540
What's with that stupid girl?!

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:57.890
Hey, let go of me!

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.770
I'm gonna curse her!

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:02.640
You can't curse anyone.

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:05.600
You see how annoyed he looks?

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:08.820
This is a good opportunity for him 
to get used to being around humans.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:11.700
You probably realize that 
he can't go on like this.

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:18.120
He may be able to see us, but he 
lives in the human world, not ours.

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:20.630
You have no idea!

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:23.720
Satoru got used to putting up walls

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:26.300
because of the people 
he was living with.

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:29.840
He knows what he has to do, 
but it's hard to change.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:32.300
Ah, that's nice.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:35.340
I'll always be there for him.

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:39.480
But I know it's not good for him.

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:42.270
So I'll control myself today!

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:44.670
I'm not doing this 
because you told me to!

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:45.560
Yeah, yeah.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:49.100
I thought you'd be taller.

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:50.870
You're the same height I am?

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:51.990
Yu-Yumi-chan!

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:54.110
But that means he's 
shorter than Funabashi.

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:56.540
That bitch!

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.080
I thought you were going 
to control yourself.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:00.290
Oh. Welcome, girls.

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:02.460
You're wearing a kimono, too!

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:06.100
I have a ground-breaking 
ceremony to attend.

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:09.240
U-Um, thank you 
for having us over.

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:11.510
This is a little something.

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:13.430
Oh, why thank you.

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:17.760
Well, I'll try to hurry home.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.600
Okay, goodbye.

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:23.310
Funabashi-san?

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:26.690
I found it odd that you weren't 
interested in any guys at school.

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:27.960
So that's why...

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:30.300
You don't like immature boys, huh?

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:31.940
I-It's not like that!

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.890
I knew something was up.

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:36.090
You were so eager to come along.

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:37.010
Do you have a father complex?

00:08:37.010 --> 00:08:39.940
Stop it! You're being rude!

00:08:39.940 --> 00:08:41.250
Satoru-kun?

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.020
I'm grateful for the welcome party,

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:47.810
but I don't enjoy loud celebrations.

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:50.460
Sorry about moving ahead with 
this without asking you first.

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:54.970
But everybody's here 
and Dad's all excited.

00:08:57.320 --> 00:08:59.390
Let me know when everything's ready.

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:05.090
Man, he's no fun.

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:07.260
I didn't get a chance to 
tell him yesterday...

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:09.570
What?! You didn't tell him?

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:11.590
Isn't this your fault, Ikegami-san?

00:09:11.590 --> 00:09:13.780
Huh? What did I do wrong?

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:16.250
Whatever, let's go shopping.

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:18.130
My dad left a list.

00:09:18.130 --> 00:09:19.790
Lots of snacks!

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:27.790
Well, let's welcome Satoru-kun!

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:29.710
Cheers!

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:33.730
You're such a good cook, Mr. Saeki.

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:36.180
It was only possible 
with everybody's help.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.140
And then you have...

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.600
I-I'm sorry...

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:42.050
Don't worry.

00:09:42.050 --> 00:09:44.200
It's a little burnt, 
but it still tastes good.

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:46.450
Anyway, you kids should 
knock yourself out!

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:47.810
How's the food, Satoru-kun?

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.770
I-It's good.

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:53.000
So you listen to Mr. Saeki.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:55.920
When's your birthday, Satoru-kun?

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:57.990
Yes, we'll want to celebrate.

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:01.400
Anyway, you were all 
wearing kimonos today.

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:02.440
They looked nice.

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:04.640
I've only worn yukatas before.

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:06.240
Would you like to try one on tomorrow?

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:07.750
Oh? Can I?

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:10.460
That's a good idea.

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:11.190
Do you think I'll look funny?

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:13.340
What should I do?

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:17.760
Kamio!

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:19.740
Let's party together!

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:21.220
Won't you join us for a bit?

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:23.610
Thank you.

00:10:23.610 --> 00:10:26.010
But I've had enough fun.

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:27.940
You girls can enjoy yourselves.

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:30.900
Oh. Thanks for putting 
up with us today.

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:32.470
We can't force him into anything.

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:33.860
All right, shall we go upstairs?

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:38.660
Oh, Satoru!

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:39.820
Welcome back!

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:42.280
Did you have fun?

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:43.880
Yeah.

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:48.580
Are you studying?

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.850
Yeah, there's a test coming up.

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:51.170
Hey, stop it!

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:55.170
That hurts! That hurts, Ikegami-san.

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:57.920
They're so noisy.

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:59.920
Well, unlike someone else I know.

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:00.740
What do you mean?

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:03.490
What's that supposed 
to mean, Ikegami-san?!

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:09.420
They're so loud!

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:12.130
How can they keep giggling on and on?!

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:14.870
If you're curious, you can go look.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:16.900
There's nothing interesting 
happening here.

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:19.610
You're free to do what you want.

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:27.290
I'm staying here.

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:30.750
I think it's interesting here.

00:11:31.180 --> 00:11:34.480
They wanted to throw you 
a welcome party, right?

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:38.420
Doesn't that make you happy, Satoru?

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:46.600
I was happy to see other 
people being nice to you.

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:50.660
Hey, Grandpa Matsu. Why did you 
tell Satoru to take it easy?

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:54.420
He looks like he's having 
fun when he's with us.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:12:01.820
You see, Satoru has been forced to 
put up walls so he can stay here.

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:06.090
That just shows that this 
isn't where he belongs.

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:08.500
It's tiring and lonely for him.

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:10.290
But he has us.

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:15.160
True, but we are heralds, 
while Satoru is human.

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:18.260
I've spent a long time watching humans,

00:12:18.260 --> 00:12:23.170
and they belong with other humans.

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:28.670
But when you put up walls, 
you can't see other people

00:12:28.670 --> 00:12:30.680
and they can't see you.

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:38.180
So he needs to bring down 
the walls and take it easy.

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:43.110
He may be able to see us, but he 
lives in the human world, not ours.

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:49.580
I'm not sure...

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:53.670
I wasn't able to tell them 
my birthday when they asked.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:13:00.550
The only days I remember are the days 
my parents and grandfather died.

00:13:03.350 --> 00:13:04.450
Haru,

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:10.040
how do I look right now?

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:16.600
How do I look right now?

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:23.360
You look the same as always.

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:25.150
Really...

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:29.070
Satoru, if you're happy, 
you should express it.

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:31.400
It's not that hard.

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:34.640
You just have to look the way 
you do when you're with me.

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:37.040
Everyone will like you more, then.

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:40.960
<i>I'm such an idiot...</i>

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:43.840
<i>I'm making Haru worry about me again.</i>

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:47.550
This is getting boring.

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:49.460
We should go to bed.

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:51.760
It's only 11 o'clock.

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:54.180
Anyway, what's Kamio doing?

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:55.890
He's probably studying.

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.230
Seriously?

00:13:57.230 --> 00:14:00.440
It's better to let him be alone.

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:04.560
But when someone resists, it just 
makes me want to play with them more.

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:05.650
That's why cats are fun.

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:07.510
Oh, I know what you mean.

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:09.370
Stop it, Makoto!

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:11.360
Oh, well...

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:13.580
Ikegami-san, where are you going?

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:15.670
You need to ask?

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:20.920
Satoru?

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:23.490
Sorry, Haru.

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:25.270
I understand.

00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:27.500
They threw the party for my sake.

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:30.390
I'm happy that they took the effort.

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:33.850
I'll try to express myself 
better from now on.

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:37.280
Really? You don't have to do 
anything you don't want to.

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:39.410
Yes, I know.

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:43.070
Why are they so loud?

00:14:44.080 --> 00:14:45.730
Excuse us!

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.910
Wh-What are you doing?

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:50.530
I want to know more about you.

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.370
Let's chat a bit.

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:55.580
Sorry, Haru-chan.

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:57.420
Ikegami-san, this is...

00:14:57.420 --> 00:15:00.250
You really are studying...

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:02.130
What is this problem?

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:04.750
What?! He's already 
learned how to do this?!

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:06.280
That reminds me.

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:08.420
So, when's your birthday?

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:10.720
S-September 23rd.

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:14.130
Hey! Stop that girl!

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:18.140
Th-This might be a good chance for 
Satoru-kun to get to know them.

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:20.140
This is making things worse!

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.780
What's your bloodtype?

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:23.160
I'm guessing it's B.

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:24.270
A.

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:26.860
And you're the same 
height as me, right?

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:29.040
Cut it out!

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:31.240
Give that back!

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:33.000
Why do you want to know more about me?

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:35.200
You're a transfer student. 
People want to know these things.

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:37.600
See?! Now stop her!

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:39.200
I can't do anything about this.

00:15:40.510 --> 00:15:43.170
Forget it. Have it your way.

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:46.270
I've never seen kendo 
gear close up before...

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:48.230
U-Um...

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:51.930
Could you show me your notes?

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:55.550
That's a nice shot of you getting cozy.

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:59.730
What?! You shouldn't take 
pictures without permission!

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:02.140
It doesn't hurt anyone.

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:03.940
Anyway, we should get going.

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:05.990
Yeah! Leave!

00:16:05.990 --> 00:16:08.660
Oh, so this is what kendo 
gear looks like...

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:08.660
Don't change the subject!

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:09.740
<i>What's going on...?</i>

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:12.720
<i>Why did this happen?</i>

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:17.510
<i>No, I'm sure they're 
doing this for my sake.</i>

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:20.250
<i>I was a little happy when they came.</i>

00:16:21.280 --> 00:16:22.860
<i>Happy?</i>

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:24.590
<i>Really?</i>

00:16:24.590 --> 00:16:27.310
<i>Are they really doing this to help me?</i>

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:29.690
<i>I keep telling them that I 
don't want them to bother me.</i>

00:16:29.690 --> 00:16:32.590
<i>And I'm supposed to endure it?</i>

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:34.300
Be quiet!

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:40.220
Ow! What was that for?!

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:42.850
I'm the one asking questions here!

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:44.380
What are you girls trying to do?!

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:45.410
Stop writing down notes!

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:46.820
Stop taking pictures!

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:47.900
Stop touching my stuff!

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:49.860
S-Satoru...

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:52.720
I said that I don't 
like too much noise!

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:55.060
Don't you realize that 
you're bothering me?!

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:56.620
P-Plus...

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:58.030
Plus...

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:00.580
I can still grow taller!

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:03.540
S-Sorry...

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.460
Er, uh...

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:08.710
I didn't realize you had a 
complex about your height...

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:10.670
I'm sorry.

00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:15.180
Yes, Ikegami-san. You kept 
bringing up that sore subject.

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:17.170
I said that I'm sorry.

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:21.890
Huh? Why are you laughing?

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:23.410
Sorry...

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:26.720
But I don't think that's the 
reason Satoru-kun is mad.

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:28.710
But it's our fault, right?

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:30.860
Wait, it's because...

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:40.230
I feel really stupid.

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:41.670
Sorry.

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:46.170
We weren't trying to bother you, 
but we want to become friends.

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:48.890
That's right. You should have seen 
how we started with Funabashi-san.

00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:50.220
Ikegami-san!

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:53.910
So we should take this 
opportunity to talk.

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:55.670
The welcome party doesn't 
end until the day's over!

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:58.340
Is that okay?

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:02.510
I guess I can't stop you.

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:06.230
I suppose I can humor you today.

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:07.930
Really?

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:08.940
Yay!

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:11.790
Let's move the table to 
the middle of the room.

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:13.470
Sorry, Haru-chan.

00:18:13.470 --> 00:18:14.190
Huh?

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:22.540
How'd it go?

00:18:23.640 --> 00:18:26.080
It was absolutely horrible.

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.870
Those girls are crazy!

00:18:29.030 --> 00:18:34.380
So you couldn't fall asleep after 
being left alone, little kid?

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:36.620
No way!

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:41.050
But I've never seen 
Satoru act like that.

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:46.230
It's gonna keep happening.

00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:51.650
I don't care if he makes friends on 
the other side instead of our side.

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:58.150
But you look pretty lonely, 
so I guess I can keep you company.

00:18:58.770 --> 00:19:00.610
I appreciate it.

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:07.960
You all look happy.

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:09.930
Good morning!

00:19:09.930 --> 00:19:13.150
You woke us up right after 
we finally went to sleep.

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:16.010
I have bags under my eyes. 
It's embarrassing.

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:17.650
How do I look, Mr. Saeki?

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:19.470
You would all make wonderful 
shrine maidens.

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:23.700
Otomatsu-sama is his name.

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:24.770
Huh?

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:26.490
The name of Haru's partner.

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:30.440
He's an old fox spirit who gave 
me some advice before I left.

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:32.860
He told me to take it easy.

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:34.320
Take it easy....

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:39.180
You girls kind of forced 
me to relax last night.

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:43.240
I'd like to meet Otomatsu-sama.

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:44.910
I'm sure you'll get a chance.

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:48.190
Should I buy a charm?

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.570
Should I get one for academics?

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:53.500
We have midterms coming up.

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.500
You're resorting to this?

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:58.090
You're not supposed to 
buy charms for yourself.

00:19:58.570 --> 00:20:01.200
They're more effective when 
they're given as presents.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:02.870
Didn't you know that?

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:04.560
Oh, really?

00:20:04.560 --> 00:20:07.060
That sounded insulting.

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:07.970
You can have this.

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:10.020
As thanks for the welcome party.

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:10.020
<b>Academic 
Fortune</b>

00:20:10.670 --> 00:20:12.600
I'll pay for them.

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:13.690
Thanks!

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:17.270
Charms are more effective if 
you care about the person

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:18.940
you're giving them to.

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:22.480
Oh, does that mean you care about us?

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:23.820
I'm glad to hear that!

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:25.630
Hello!

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:27.520
Makoto-oneechan!

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:28.870
Aki-chan! Sa-chan!

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:29.900
Yo.

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:31.680
Oh, it's the lady who likes cats!

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:33.030
How's Mi-chan doing?

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:34.650
Mi-chan's doing great!

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:36.560
Oh? I don't know the other lady.

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:37.800
And there's a guy I don't know.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:41.540
He's a new family member.

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:43.050
Be nice to him.

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.300
Hi, there.

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:45.760
We live nearby.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:47.970
N-Nice to meet you.

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:52.040
Oh, there are many cute 
shrine maidens here today.

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:53.440
Welcome, Granny.

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:55.450
Good morning!

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:57.740
Okay, let's pay our respects!

00:20:57.740 --> 00:20:59.640
Let's! Let's!

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:01.800
We're here to thank the fox spirit.

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:04.410
Our recital went well.

00:21:06.470 --> 00:21:10.140
This shrine is completely 
different from mine.

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:13.560
Shrines are all the same.

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:14.420
Perhaps.

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:17.590
I'm sure that our shrine was the same.

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:21.300
It's just that I never noticed.

00:21:22.150 --> 00:21:24.190
That's not a big deal.

00:21:24.190 --> 00:21:25.720
Most people never notice.

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:29.720
Kamio! Let's take a picture!

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:33.060
Excuse me.

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:37.800
What were you talking to Gin about?

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:38.590
Nothing important.

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:43.120
I was just saying that this 
shrine is a nice place.

00:21:43.810 --> 00:21:46.740
I'm looking forward to staying here.

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:48.950
I'm glad to be here.

00:21:50.060 --> 00:21:51.910
Yep, glad to have you!

00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:54.250
It's so cute.

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:55.100
Isn't it?

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:57.040
You look great!

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:04.200
How do I look right now?

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:08.070
You look like you're having fun.

00:22:09.610 --> 00:22:11.930
It looks like he's left the Ama-no-Iwato.

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:13.640
Oh? What do you mean?

00:22:14.060 --> 00:22:15.460
Mr. Saeki!

00:22:15.460 --> 00:22:17.240
You should get in the picture!

00:22:17.240 --> 00:22:18.350
You too, Granny!

00:22:18.350 --> 00:22:20.130
What? Can I?

00:22:20.130 --> 00:22:21.020
Oh my...

00:22:23.010 --> 00:22:26.570
Yeah, another day of peace and quiet.

00:22:26.940 --> 00:22:29.440
Okay, say cheese!

00:22:29.440 --> 00:22:31.450
Cheese!

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:19.520
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:19.520
<b>Silver Fox</b>

00:24:11.240 --> 00:24:12.630
Yumi here!

00:24:12.630 --> 00:24:14.840
Do you know the difference 
between a shrine and a temple?

00:24:14.840 --> 00:24:16.470
You see...

00:24:17.610 --> 00:24:19.960
Actually, I don't know, either.

00:24:19.620 --> 00:26:22.310
<b>Shrine and Temple</b>

00:24:19.960 --> 00:24:22.300
Next time: "Shrine and Temple."

00:24:22.300 --> 00:24:24.620
May fortune be with you.
